---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy"
  description="Privacy information for RedRiverGorgeHiker.com."
>
  <div class="page prose">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>

    <section>
      <h2>This website</h2>
      <p>RedRiverGorgeHiker.com is a simple static photography website. It does not create visitor accounts, run its own shopping cart, or directly collect payment-card information.</p>
      <p>The site does not use advertising pixels or unnecessary third-party tracking scripts. GitHub Pages and ordinary internet infrastructure may still process standard technical information needed to deliver and secure the site.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Email</h2>
      <p>If you email Ryan, the information you choose to send may be kept when reasonably useful for responding to you or maintaining ordinary business records.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Fine Art America</h2>
      <p>Online purchases are completed on Fine Art America. Fine Art America handles the account, checkout, payment, order, shipping, and transaction information submitted through its service.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>Privacy questions may be sent to <a href="mailto:Ryan@RedRiverGorgeHiker.com">Ryan@RedRiverGorgeHiker.com</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
